             ).strip()
+    # Set only by a trusted launcher that selected both the endpoint and its
+    # Podman secret.  Keeping this separate from OPENAI_API_KEY preserves the
+    # resolver's protection against forwarding a general OpenAI credential to
+    # an arbitrary custom hostname.
